Z||000011||Racer 1||10-08-1999||11:32 PM||||The two things that piss me off the most when im driving that other idiots do is 1: Im in the far right lane "slow lane" then when the people pass me they almost hit me trying to get into my lane on the highway and not using there signals. 2: Then damn tailgaters god that pisses me off. Back in the day when I had my station wagon a guy in a f-150 ford was tailgating me as soon as we hit 55 on the highway he was about 5 <BR>feet behind me. I slammed on my brakes to make a side street he had his brakes locked up also I wish he woulda hit me he was about 6 inches from my bumper. Someone needs to make a little remote control middle finger that you could pop up. ||||reg||8
